   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed all three orders to a specialist, with a note explaining your concerns on each one. Here are your reference numbers:\n\n- **#6502 (Pho Real): ESC-700**\n- **#6503 (Taqueria Luz): ESC-701**\n- **#6504 (Burger Barn): ESC-702**\n\nA specialist will contact you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide, but they'll have the full details.\n\nNothing already issued will change in the meantime:\n- **$30.00 account credit**, available now ($25.00 for #6501 and $5.00 for #6502)\n- **$9.00 refund** for the summer rolls to your Visa ending 4242 (reference RF-4000), arriving in 3\u20135 business days\n\nI'm sorry this week's orders have been so frustrating. Is there anything else I can help with tonight?"
